1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,057
Every night, while the city slept,

2
00:00:03,057 --> 00:00:07,511
my father kept watch over a mall that
was not his.

3
00:00:08,611 --> 00:00:13,942
He sat by the doors in his old coat,
through the long night shift.

4
00:00:19,042 --> 00:00:21,363
In the morning he came home tired,

5
00:00:21,363 --> 00:00:24,493
and still he made sure I went to school.

6
00:00:25,593 --> 00:00:27,484
A good school.

7
00:00:29,093 --> 00:00:34,224
A school he could not afford, until he
decided he could.

8
00:00:35,324 --> 00:00:40,095
He never told me what it cost him. I
learned it from his coat.

9
00:00:41,324 --> 00:00:45,624
Today I work for a good company. I can
help him now.

10
00:00:45,624 --> 00:00:49,415
But I am not where I want to be. Not
yet.

11
00:00:50,515 --> 00:00:54,566
Because one day, I will rebuild his
house.

12
00:00:56,515 --> 00:01:00,046
Abba, this is my promise.

13
00:01:03,415 --> 00:01:06,215
The Night Keeper
Made with AI, from a true family story
